  },
  data: {
    LLM: "The player on dealer's right leads the first trick with the last card dealt to them. Players in counterclockwise order must follow led suit if possible. A player without led suit may play a joker if desired. If all active players contribute a card, trick is completed; highest card wins, and if jokers appear the first joker played is highest. If a player cannot follow and does not play a joker, trick ends immediately: later players do not play, that player picks one non-joker card from trick into hand, and remaining trick cards are set aside face down. Trick winner leads next trick (with special handling if winner just played final card and has no cards left). Players who empty hand drop out; play continues until one player still has cards.",
    Player: "The player on dealer's right leads the first trick with the last card dealt to them. Players in counterclockwise order must follow led suit if possible. A player without led suit may play a joker if desired. If all active players contribute a card, trick is completed; highest card wins, and if jokers appear the first joker played is highest. If a player cannot follow and does not play a joker, trick ends immediately: later players do not play, that player picks one non-joker card from trick into hand, and remaining trick cards are set aside face down. Trick winner leads next trick (with special handling if winner just played final card and has no cards left). Players who empty hand drop out; play continues until one player still has cards.",
    objective: 'In each game, avoid being the last player still holding cards. Across a series, survive eliminations to become champion.',
    gameplay: "The player on dealer's right leads the first trick with the last card dealt to them. Players in counterclockwise order must follow led suit if possible. A player without led suit may play a joker if desired. If all active players contribute a card, trick is completed; highest card wins, and if jokers appear the first joker played is highest. If a player cannot follow and does not play a joker, trick ends immediately: later players do not play, that player picks one non-joker card from trick into hand, and remaining trick cards are set aside face down. Trick winner leads next trick (with special handling if winner just played final card and has no cards left). Players who empty hand drop out; play continues until one player still has cards.",
    keyRules: [
      'Follow suit is mandatory when possible.',
      'Joker is highest rank and can be played when void; if joker is led, others may play any cards.',
      'On interrupted tricks, picker cannot take a joker from the trick.',
      'Series format eliminates the loser of each game; with two players each game is simply winner versus loser.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
