    exampleHands: [
      'Setup example: 0 card(s) per player.',
      'Rule example: In each game, avoid being the last player still holding cards. Across a series, survive eliminations to become champion.',
      "Turn-flow example: The player on dealer's right leads the first trick with the last card dealt to them. Players in counterclockwise order must follow led suit if possible. A player without led suit may play a joker if desired. If all active players contribute a card, trick is completed; highest card wins, and if jokers appear the first joker played is highest. If a player cannot follow and does not play a joker, trick ends immediately: later players do not play, that player picks one non-joker card from trick into hand, and remaining trick cards are set aside face down. Trick winner leads next trick (with special handling if winner just played final card and has no cards left). Players who empty hand drop out; play continues until one player still has cards.",
      'Scoring example: Outcome is elimination-based: each game identifies one loser (last player with cards), and series continues with that player removed in multiplayer mode. Across series, be the last remaining player not eliminated..',
